# Supabase migration rules

- Target project ref: `udwdurnknweavmksotii` when discussing hosted HQ.
- Local migration filenames may differ from hosted `schema_migrations.version`. Match by migration **name**.
- Commercial migrations listed in `docs/CURSOR_HANDOVER.md` are already applied — never reapply.
- No hosted DDL/DML without explicit approval. Prefer `supabase db query --linked` for read-only verification.
- New work: `supabase migration new <name>`, additive SQL, RLS on exposed tables, `service_role` for privileged RPCs called only after server-side authz.
- Historical jobs/scheduling Git migrations are incomplete vs live schema; see `docs/tradify-migration-and-google-calendar.md`.
